      "writtenOn": "2022-03-11T17:41:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see this - the code to create these objects is not gated on s_stack_depth.\n\nAh - I see what you\u0027re getting at - open_or_create will open or create, so your assumption is that this will create at stack level 0. But this means that if there is a different stacking fs this will go wrong. I think we need to store whether or not they were opened or created, and use that to decide whether to delete them.",
      "parentUuid": "7afa454e_cf329b51",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1904,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1904,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "aef3755e49ead3a88a0ec8a80b13c62b83dbdc1b",
